6) Cluster jobs and checking output
-----------------------------------
First fix the symbolic links at
  /home/sergio/HITRAN2UMBCLBL/LBLRTM/
and make the Toffset directories using   test_mkerTxoff.sc     makes
See the "Readme_links_Toffset" in that directory

which has

  make ToffALL (a symbolic link) and some subdirs
  --------------------------------------------------
  
  mkdir /home/sergio/nogit/H2024_RUN8_NIRDATABASE/LBLRTM_ToffALL
  ln -s /home/sergio/nogit/H2024_RUN8_NIRDATABASE/LBLRTM_ToffALL ToffALL
  
  now run
    mker_TOFFSETS_1_5.sc  >& ughm
    copy_TOFFSETS_1_5.sc  >& ughc
  which makes ToffALL/Toff_01 .. ToffALL/Toff_11
              ToffALL/Toff2_01 .. ToffALL/Toff2_11
              ToffALL/Toff3_01 .. ToffALL/Toff3_11
              ToffALL/Toff4_01 .. ToffALL/Toff4_11
              ToffALL/Toff5_01 .. ToffALL/Toff5_11
  and then copies the *.m and other files, as well as the symbolic links to lblrtm, slblrtm etc

Then
  /bin/rm slurm*.out; sbatch --array=1-22 sergio_matlab_chip_jobB.sbatch  (parse_job_string.m has "file_parallelprocess_gas_2_6.txt" for gases2,6)

compare_LBLRTM12p4_LBLRTM12p8(gid,chunk,toffset)

